  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 17 ÷ 5 + 216 × 3 + 33 - 930 × 3 + 28 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, '+' and '-' are interchanged and also '×' and '÷' are interchanged:\n\n17 ÷ 5 + 216 × 3 + 33 - 930 × 3 + 28 = ? ⇒ 17 × 5 - 216 ÷ 3 - 33 + 930 ÷ 3 - 28 = ?\n\n⇒ 17 × 5 - __**216 **____**÷**____** 3**__ - 33 + __**930 **____**÷**____** 3**__ - 28 = ?\n\n⇒ __**17 ×**____** 5**__ - 72 - 33 + 310 - 28 = ?\n\n⇒ __**85 + 310**__ - 72 - 33 - 28 = ?\n\n⇒ __395____** - 72 - 33 - 28**__ = ?\n\n⇒ **262 = ?**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
